  <ai_direction_summary>The AI's thinking went into exhaustive case-by-case game-tree analysis of small cases (especially k=2,n=2 and k=3,n=3), spending enormous effort on interpretation questions (whether the player sees the wizard's permutation) and detailed move-by-move tracking, without ever identifying the general k<n structural pattern.</ai_direction_summary>
